# About the Ф Platform

The Ф Platform is a multidimensional web ecosystem. We are committed to integrating data and exploring the best models for organizing and using it—so that every visit uncovers something new and remarkable.

## Platform and Services

The Ф Platform offers the following core services:

- **[Ф social](https://www.fuyeor.com) — Social Network**: A lightweight, open social platform where users can share their lives, exchange ideas, and connect with one another.
- **[Ф community](https://community.fuyeor.com) — Q&A Community**: An open, mutually supportive question-and-answer platform where users can ask questions, share knowledge, and join discussions.
- **[Ф know](https://know.fuyeor.com) — Collaborative Encyclopedia**: A collaboratively written and maintained knowledge base that brings together content from multiple domains, with support for collaborative editing and structured presentation.
- **[Agender.me](https://agender.me) — Personal Link Page Service**: A link aggregation page service designed for agender people, LGBT+ individuals, and allies, helping users showcase their personal profiles and important links on social platforms.

## Our Mission

> Integrate data, explore the best models for organizing and using data, and let every visit uncover something new and remarkable.

We believe that friendlier information architecture and more open product forms can help people express themselves more freely, access information more efficiently, and build connections more naturally.

The Ф Platform will continue to explore the intersection of social networking, knowledge, and tools, building a sustainable, valuable, and user-respecting digital ecosystem.